  "intro": "Brazil is a continent disguised as a country — beaches, rainforest, giant waterfalls, and a festival calendar that never really stops. This guide covers the big picture: where to go, when to go, what to eat and where to stay, with ready-made 5, 7 and 10-day routes.",
